## Issue 2: Does Nav2 Avoid Obstacles?

**YES! 100% YES!** 🎯

### Nav2 Includes:

✅ **Global Planner** - Plans path around known obstacles (from map)
✅ **Local Planner** - Real-time obstacle avoidance (from LiDAR)
✅ **Costmaps** - Marks obstacles and safe zones
✅ **Recovery Behaviors** - Backs up if stuck

### How It Works:
```
