Understanding the Problem:
Why Static Transform is BAD:
bash

# Static transform says:
"Robot is ALWAYS at position (0, 0, 0) - NEVER moves"

# But robot IS moving in Gazebo!
# So Nav2 thinks: "Robot says it's at (0,0) but map shows it elsewhere - CONFUSED!"

Result: Nav2 can't navigate because odometry and actual position don't match!
