Algorithm Used: SLAM Toolbox (Graph-based SLAM)

Why SLAM Toolbox:

    Industry-standard for ROS2
    Graph-based optimization approach
    Real-time performance
    Loop closure detection
    Supports both online mapping and localization

How It Works:

    Frontend: Matches consecutive LiDAR scans using scan matching
    Backend: Builds pose graph and optimizes using Ceres solver
    Loop Closure: Detects when robot revisits areas, corrects drift
    Output: 2D occupancy grid map (unknown=grey, free=white, occupied=black)

